      {
        "name": "places/ChIJQdfc9_cJBDQRI3nFjBOHiOo/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WVlkydFhVRmwwZDJJd1VGOUVTVVZzTkdWU2MwRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 個月前",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": {
          "text": "To be honest, it is an overall disappointed experience. The handmade ragu spaghetti is in little amount, which can literally be finished in 5 minutes with only 5-spoon amount. As a slim or even underweight person, it is not enough let alone those gym buddies. Also, for the taste, it is not special at all.\n\nIf you are looking for a small local restaurant with hand-drawing posters to attract kids, you could try once. Otherwise, it is not recommended.\n\n餐廳食物味道普通，份量甚少。環境有自己畫的圖案可以俾小朋友睇。總結黎講，唔推薦！",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "To be honest, it is an overall disappointed experience. The handmade ragu spaghetti is in little amount, which can literally be finished in 5 minutes with only 5-spoon amount. As a slim or even underweight person, it is not enough let alone those gym buddies. Also, for the taste, it is not special at all.\n\nIf you are looking for a small local restaurant with hand-drawing posters to attract kids, you could try once. Otherwise, it is not recommended.\n\n餐廳食物味道普通，份量甚少。環境有自己畫的圖案可以俾小朋友睇。總結黎講，唔推薦！",
